    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a454bfe9d2f574368411615</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关键词：【旅行】【埃及】【金字塔】【木乃伊】【神庙】【历史】【文化】【美食】【攻略】</span></p><p><span>制作人：老韩</span></p><p><span>主播：老韩、小曹、黄老师</span></p><p><span>主播老韩与黄老师刚刚结束了一次埃及深度游，这是一次难忘的旅行，这里是关于他们旅行的一切。希望可以帮助到想要去埃及的你。</span></p><p><strong><span>闲白 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>旅程总览+行前准备 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>D1-D3 开罗 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">1:15:45</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：D1-中午到达，修整；D2-吉萨金字塔群、大埃及博物馆；D3-埃及国家博物馆、穆伊兹大街+喀拉温建筑群+艾资哈尔清真寺+苏丹哈桑清真寺+里法伊清真寺、夜游尼罗河。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：开罗万豪酒店；khufu restrant、restaurant EL menoufy EI kabagi、sizzler steak house、zooba、simonds。</span></p><p><strong><span>D4-D5 亚历山大 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">1:15:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5230">1:27:10</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：D4-中午到达，地下墓穴、庞贝柱、凯特贝城堡；D5-希腊罗马博物馆、亚历山大图书馆。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：绿色广场希尔顿酒店；Koshary Abu Nasser、arous elbahr、delices patisserie alexandria。</span></p><p><strong><span>D6-D7 阿斯旺 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5230">1:27:10</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6090">1:41:30</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：D6-中午到达，菲莱神庙、尼罗河落日帆船；D7-阿斯旺大坝、阿布辛贝神庙。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：巴锡马行政俱乐部酒店；Abeer restaurant、KFC。</span></p><p><strong><span>D8-D9 卢克索 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6090">1:41:30</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6780">1:53:00</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：D8-中午到达，卡纳克神庙、卢克索神庙、卢克索市场；D9-哈特切普苏特神庙、帝王谷、哈布城、门农巨像。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：索尼斯塔圣乔治酒店；rustic restaurant、Oriental house restaurant。</span></p><p><strong><span>D10-D11赫尔格达 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6780">1:53:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7500">2:05:00</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：酒店躺平。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：天翁海滨城堡酒店；酒店内各个餐厅。</span></p><p><strong><span>D12-D13开罗 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7500">2:05:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8700">2:25:00</a></span></strong></p><p><span>行程：D12-下午到达，citystar、哈利利市场；D13-悬空教堂、萨拉丁城堡、垃圾城、洞穴教堂。</span></p><p><span>酒店&amp;美食：拉美西斯希尔顿酒店；Abou AI Sid restaurant、Nisantasi。</span></p><p><strong><span>总结 &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8700">2:25:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9060">2:31:00</a></span></strong></p><p></p>]]></description>
